<p style="margin:0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6">is what it costs, on average, to rehome one cat. Cats who need medical attention can cost considerably more.</p>
</div>
<ul style="list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0">
<li style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #C4CEDD; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55">Secure payment by card, plus Apple Pay and Google Pay where your device supports them.</li>
<li style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #C4CEDD; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55">A receipt is emailed to you after your gift.</li>
<li style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #C4CEDD; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55">Happy Paws is a registered charity run by dedicated volunteers.</li>
</ul>
