<!-- Questions -->
<section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-h" class="sec" style="background:#ffffff">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="two-grid">
<div>
<h2 id="faq-h" class="h2" style="color:#ED217C; margin-bottom:20px">Questions <br>about giving</h2>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:17px; line-height:1.6">Can't find what you need? Email us at <a class="link-u" href="mailto:info@happypawscatrescue.org" style="color:#CC1264; font-weight:500">info@happypawscatrescue.org</a>.</p>
</div>
<div style="border-top:1px solid #C4CEDD">
<details class="faq" open="">
<summary>Is my donation secure?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="chev"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary>
<p class="faq-a">Yes. Your payment is handled by a secure payment provider (Stripe), so your card details never pass through our website.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq">
<summary>Can I change or cancel a monthly gift?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="chev"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary>
<p class="faq-a">Yes. Email us at info@happypawscatrescue.org and we will change or cancel it for you. [Once the Stripe customer portal is switched on, add that donors can also do this themselves from the link in their receipt email.]</p>
</details>
<details class="faq">
<summary>Will I get a receipt?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="chev"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary>
<p class="faq-a">Yes. A receipt is emailed to you after your gift. If it doesn't arrive, check your spam folder or email us.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq">
<summary>Who are Happy Paws?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="chev"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary>
<p class="faq-a">We're a registered charity run by dedicated volunteers, based in Stockton, with foster homes in Birmingham and Banbury too.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq">
<summary>Can I give by bank transfer instead?<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="chev"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary>
<p class="faq-a">Yes. You'll find our bank details under <a class="link-u" href="#other" style="color:#CC1264; font-weight:500">Other ways to give</a>.</p>
</details>
